<title>USA: Frontier offers local service in New York.</title>
<headline>Frontier offers local service in New York.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frontier Corp said on Tuesday it was offering local telephone service in New York City as an alternative local exchange company.</p>
<p>Frontier said it was providing local service in Manhattan through its own switch and through its local resale agreement with NYNEX Corp.</p>
<p>Frontier offers local, long-distance, paging, cellular, calling cards, voice mail and toll-free services.</p>
</text>
